{"unit_id":"tag:03RR:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为代数闭（algebraically closed）的域（field）<MATH_0002>上的仿射（affine）光滑（smooth）曲线（curve），并设<MATH_0003>。设<MATH_0004>为光滑（smooth）射影（projective）紧化（compactification）（代数簇（Varieties）注记<REF_0001>）。设<MATH_0005>为<MATH_0006>的亏格（genus），并设<MATH_0007>为<MATH_0008>的点（points）的个数。则\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0009>；\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0010>，且\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0011>，对所有<MATH_0012>成立。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraically closed","target_term":"代数闭"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"curve","target_term":"曲线"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"projective","target_term":"射影"},{"source_term":"compactification","target_term":"紧化"},{"source_term":"Varieties","target_term":"代数簇"},{"source_term":"genus","target_term":"亏格"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraically closed","target_term":"代数闭","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"curve","target_term":"曲线","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"projective","target_term":"射影","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"compactification","target_term":"紧化","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Varieties","target_term":"代数簇","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"genus","target_term":"亏格","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
